{
  "review_date": "2026-10-02",
  "scope": "Selected normal entry/cross-core paths and conditional unit-test/RTT boundaries; not whole-file correctness or device acceptance. Reviewed test-only batch/console mailbox, result lifecycle, RAM observation and SPI completion boundaries on 2026-10-02; no device execution.",
  "git_head": "30c7227121fb6d0045e23745432730debab404af",
  "basis": "Working tree bytes including existing local modifications",
  "audit_addendum_review_date": "2026-10-12",
  "audit_addendum_scope": "CM3 audit initialization, connection/time/address recording, ring storage and RTT query/access boundary. Existing matching file hashes retained; newly reviewed files appended. PC/RAM evidence is not device acceptance.",
  "hardware_clarification_date": "2026-10-13",
  "hardware_clarification_basis": "Direct user confirmation, recorded in Sound1 시스템 구조.md sections 1 and 6.2. Wiring clarification is not derived from the E8300 source hashes and does not confirm QCC pin/clock/codec settings or device acceptance.",
  "source_identity_recheck_date": "2026-10-19",
  "system_test_audit_review_date": "2026-10-15",
  "system_test_audit_scope": "Default-off SYS-050/051 RTT display of fixed 2026-05-29 RAM vectors, TEST provenance on every row, no event-file/time/address writes or automatic-hook changes. Existing SYS7/SYS23/DIO35=1 preserved. PC display checks and SDK builds do not establish actual connection, corruption detection or system-test acceptance.",
  "system_test_23_review_date": "2026-10-14",
  "system_test_23_scope": "Default-off CM3 RTT alarm-only 19-percent injection, actual battery/power protections retained. Existing alarm request and gate observed, bounded one-cycle/5-second input, no NVM/map changes. Four SDK images and PC checks, not device acceptance. Existing DIO35 CM3/CFX=1 and SYS7=1 preserved.",
  "system_test_dio35_review_date": "2026-10-14",
  "system_test_dio35_scope": "CM3 GPIO35 low-latch/init and CFX FIFO4-to-pcmDataOut timing markers, initially both default-off. SDK CID101 SET/CLR and boot ordering checked, no normal processing/shared-layout change. User confirmed the current board's DIO35 is an unused pin/test pad suitable for GPIO output on 2026-10-14; see Sound1 시스템 구조.md section 7.1. Follow-up found only the CFX header default changed from 0 to 1, with CM3 still 0; preserved without editing source or rerunning builds. Both must be 1 for SYS-012. Other board revisions need a new wiring check. Waveform/deadline acceptance remains unmeasured; no device execution.",
  "system_test_7_review_date": "2026-10-13",
  "system_test_7_scope": "Compile-time-gated RTT command and isolated CM3 foreground hold. User-enabled header value 1 preserved. Parameter input uses a test-only C*width charge check and existing error/LED path; legacy commands still expose actual product calculation. Product charge guard and failed-result publication policies are preserved. SDK OFF/ON and host checks do not establish physical LED or system acceptance.",
  "system_test_storage_review_date": "2026-10-16",
  "system_test_storage_scope": "SYS54 read-only unencrypted FEZ/CRC with RAM faults (not boot execution); SYS73 actual audit functions with isolated RAM I/O; SYS77 synthetic actual CRC/AES scratch-file roundtrip. SYS80 arm/check/clear use SYS80.TST only: actual CRC mismatch triggers test-file factory defaults from ci_map.c and reread verification without reboot. Legacy restore alone writes ISD1 from a verified old backup. FS sync/close failures stop subsequent tests on uncertain file lifetime; product return/error policy retained. User switches 54/73/77/80=1 preserved on 2026-10-16. Host/SDK checks are not device or boot acceptance.",
  "files": [
